//
// IN conversation.v1 BECAUSE EVERY PRODUCER SHARES IT: the shim counts its
// session's calls into its measurements frame (shim.v1.ShimMeasurements),
// and Emacs reports its own headless calls to the daemon
// (agentrepl.v1.ReportVendorSpend). conversation.v1 is the one package both
// import, and it is where PromptOrigin's causes are declared.
